[QUEUE: Shift for orders, building and placement. Tap to latch, hold for one.]
	{
	zh-Hant=排隊：命令、建造和放置的Shift鍵。點按鎖定，長按單次生效。;
	}

[ADD: Shift for selecting, so taps, boxes and groups add to the selection. Tap to latch, hold for one.]
	{
	zh-Hant=追加：選擇時的Shift鍵，點按、框選和編隊都會加入當前選擇。點按鎖定，長按單次生效。;
	}

[x5: Shift for the build buttons, five at a time. Tap to latch, hold for one.]
	{
	zh-Hant=x5：建造按鈕的Shift鍵，每次5個。點按鎖定，長按單次生效。;
	}

[CLEAR: takes back the armed order or the building being placed, else clears the selection.]
	{
	zh-Hant=清除：撤回已啟用的命令或正在放置的建築，否則清除選擇。;
	}

[SELECT: selects all units, builders, factories, aircraft, the units on screen, the commander or the same type.]
	{
	zh-Hant=選擇：選擇所有單位、建造單位、工廠、飛機、螢幕內單位、指揮官或同類型單位。;
	}

[STORE: stores the selection as the lowest free group.]
	{
	zh-Hant=存儲：將選中單位存為編號最小的空閒編隊。;
	}

[Group: tap to select it, tap again to centre on it, hold to store the selection in it.]
	{
	zh-Hant=編隊：點按選擇，再次點按居中顯示，長按將當前選擇存入。;
	}

[PAUSE: pauses or resumes the game.]
	{
	zh-Hant=暫停：暫停或繼續遊戲。;
	}

[SPEED: makes the game slower or faster.]
	{
	zh-Hant=速度：減慢或加快遊戲。;
	}

[CHAT: writes a message to the other players.]
	{
	zh-Hant=聊天：給其他玩家發送訊息。;
	}

[CENTRE: centres the view on the selected unit.]
	{
	zh-Hant=居中：將視圖移到選中單位上。;
	}

[FOLLOW: the view follows the selected unit; tap again for the next one.]
	{
	zh-Hant=跟隨：視圖跟隨選中單位；再次點按切換到下一個。;
	}

[NEXT: centres the view on the next unit not yet visited.]
	{
	zh-Hant=下一單位：將視圖移到下一個尚未查看的單位。;
	}

[INFO: shows the selected unit's information.]
	{
	zh-Hant=資訊：顯示選中單位的資訊。;
	}

[MENU: opens the game menu.]
	{
	zh-Hant=選單：打開遊戲選單。;
	}

[BUILD: opens the builder's build pages, or the orders page for other units.]
	{
	zh-Hant=建造：打開建造單位的建造頁，其他單位則打開命令頁。;
	}

[Zoom out: shows more of the battlefield.]
	{
	zh-Hant=縮小：顯示更大範圍的戰場。;
	}

[Zoom in: shows the battlefield closer.]
	{
	zh-Hant=放大：拉近顯示戰場。;
	}

[Order: tap to arm it, then tap where it goes; tap again to take it back.]
	{
	zh-Hant=命令：點按啟用，然後點按目標位置；再次點按可撤回。;
	}

[MORE: the other orders, fire and move orders, on and off, cloak and self-destruct.]
	{
	zh-Hant=更多：其他命令、開火和移動命令、開/關、隱形和自毀。;
	}

[BUILD: shows the builder's build pages.]
	{
	zh-Hant=建造：顯示建造單位的建造頁。;
	}

[Closes the build drawer.]
	{
	zh-Hant=關閉建造欄。;
	}

[Shows the previous page.]
	{
	zh-Hant=顯示上一頁。;
	}

[Shows the next page.]
	{
	zh-Hant=顯示下一頁。;
	}

[CANCEL: stops placing the building.]
	{
	zh-Hant=取消：停止放置建築。;
	}

[Takes back the armed order.]
	{
	zh-Hant=撤回已啟用的命令。;
	}

[Chooses this item.]
	{
	zh-Hant=選擇此項。;
	}

[SELF-DESTRUCT: hold to start or stop the selection's self-destruct countdown.]
	{
	zh-Hant=自毀：長按開始或停止選中單位的自毀倒計時。;
	}

[Gives this order at the held point.]
	{
	zh-Hant=在長按處下達此命令。;
	}

[QUEUE: the next order picked is queued after the selection's orders.]
	{
	zh-Hant=排隊：下一個選擇的命令將排在選中單位現有命令之後。;
	}

[Closes the open menu.]
	{
	zh-Hant=關閉打開的選單。;
	}

[FORCE: Ctrl for orders and selecting while held, so a click forces fire on the ground or a friend.]
	{
	zh-Hant=強制：按住時作為命令和選擇的Ctrl鍵，點擊即可強制向地面或友軍開火。;
	}

[Build ring: presses its build button or toggle, or turns the build page.]
	{
	zh-Hant=建造環：按下其建造按鈕或開關，或翻動建造頁。;
	}

[Group: select it, again to centre on it, hold to store the selection in it.]
	{
	zh-Hant=編隊：選擇它，再次選擇居中顯示，長按將當前選擇存入。;
	}

