	zh-Hant=從Core Prime獲取語言包、模組和地圖包。;
	}

[Lists of what is new are checked as the game starts and when the Library opens.]
	{
	zh-Hant=遊戲啟動時以及打開資源庫時，會檢查有哪些新內容。;
	}

[A random install ID, one per registry, is sent only when downloading from that registry.]
	{
	zh-Hant=每個內容源各有一個隨機安裝ID，僅在從該內容源下載時才會發送。;
	}

[Your install ID]
	{
	zh-Hant=你的安裝ID;
	}

[A random 128-bit number, made the first time you download from a registry, not when the game starts. Each registry that asks has its own. Core Prime asks for one. It is sent only when asking that registry for a download. Turning it off forgets it, and downloads from that registry stop. Built-in languages and files you open keep working.]
	{
	zh-Hant=一個128位的隨機數，在你首次從某個內容源下載時生成，而不是在遊戲啟動時。每個要求它的內容源各有一個。Core Prime會要求一個。只在向該內容源請求下載時發送。關閉後即忘記它，來自該內容源的下載也會停止。內置語言和你打開的檔案仍可使用。;
	}

[Turn on online features]
	{
	zh-Hant=開啟線上功能;
	}

[Not now]
	{
	zh-Hant=暫不;
	}

[Check for content updates stays at Automatically, and Core Prime's install ID stays on.]
